Modelled a many-to-many relationship between Orders and Grocery Items and a one-to-many relationship between
Customers and Orders using JPA/Hibernate with a join table, reflecting real-world grocery cart behaviour.
Implemented auto-computed order total price at the service layer by aggregating line-item prices at order creation,
keeping business logic decoupled from the persistence layer.
Applied MVCS layered architecture with dedicated Controller, Service, and Repository classes per entity, using
interface-driven service contracts for loose coupling and testability.